{"code":"YL16","wikidata":"Q119010086","wikipedia":{"en":"Si Udom MRT station","th":"สถานีศรีอุดม"},"summary":{"en":"Si Udom station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Srinagarindra Road in Prawet District, Bangkok and is a portmanteau of the name of Srinagarindra and Udom Suk (Sukhumvit 103) roads, which intersect adjacent to the station. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีศรีอุดม เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง ยกระดับเหนือถนนศรีนครินทร์ในพื้นที่เขตประเวศ กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-06-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Si_Udom_Station_01.jpg/960px-Si_Udom_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Udom_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Si_Udom_Station_02.jpg/960px-Si_Udom_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Udom_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Si_Udom_Station_03.jpg/960px-Si_Udom_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Udom_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Si_Udom_Station_04.jpg/960px-Si_Udom_Station_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Udom_Station_04.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Si_Udom_Station_05.jpg/960px-Si_Udom_Station_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_camp